<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Nuevo Energy started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Nuevo Energy started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Lehman Bros analyst James Whipkey said in a research note that he initiated coverage of Nuevo Energy Co with an outperform rating.</p>
<p>-- 12-month price target is $46 to $48 per share.</p>
<p>-- Shares were off 3/8 to 37 in early New York Stock Exchange trade.</p>
